      "note": "Server-side listener context (shared by the SMTP and IMAP servers): VERIFY_NONE here disables requesting/verifying CLIENT certificates, which these servers never use - IMAP/SMTP clients authenticate via SASL (SCRAM/PLAIN) and verify OUR certificate. No outbound connection is made with this context, so no peer verification is being bypassed."
